@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home — Greeting Binding</PageTitle>

<div style="padding: 2rem;">

    <div class="hero-section">
        <div style="position:relative; z-index:1;">
            <div style="font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px; opacity:0.75; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                Visual Programming · Lab 04
            </div>
            <h1>Application 01</h1>
            <p>Greeting Binding — Blazor Two-Way &amp; One-Way Data Binding Demo</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-3 mb-4">

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="feature-card purple">
                <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
                <h5>Objective</h5>
                <p>Demonstrate two-way and one-way data binding using Blazor's <code>@@bind</code> directive.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="feature-card green">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚙️</div>
                <h5>Technologies</h5>
                <p>Blazor Server, Razor Components, Bootstrap 5, .NET 10.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="feature-card amber">
                <div class="feature-icon">✨</div>
                <h5>Features</h5>
                <p>Live greeting preview, reactive state management, animated feedback.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="info-badge">
        <span style="font-size:1.3rem;">📘</span>
        <span>
            <strong>Student Assignment Project</strong> — Visual Programming Lab · Demonstrates core Blazor data binding concepts.
        </span>
    </div>

</div>